      <data key="d1">"Alexander Macdonell is the father of Donald Macdonell (Australian politician) and a Scottish migrant who came to Charlottenburgh Township in Upper Canada in 1792."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alexander Macdonell is the father of Donald Macdonell (Upper Canada politician) and the leader of a group of Scottish settlers who came to Charlottenburgh Township in 1792."</data>
